{"strongs": "H5387", "word": "נָשִׂיא", "translit": "na.si", "root": "נשיא", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "one lifted up", "definition": "I. נָשִׂיא 128 noun masculine one lifted up , i.e. a chief prince; — absolute ׳ נ Exod 22:27 +; construct נְשִׂיא Gen 23:6 +; plural נְשִׂיאִים Josh 22:32 +, נְשִׂיאִים Josh 22:32 +, נְשִׂאִים Exod 34:31 + 7 t., נְשִׂיאִם Gen 17:20 + 3 t., נְשִׂאִם Exod 35:27 construct נְשִׂיאֵי Exod 16:22 +; suffix נְשִׂיאַי Ezek 45:8 , נְשִׂיאֶיהָ Ezek 32:29 , נְשִׂיאֵיהֶם Num 17:21 , נְשִׂיאֵהֶם v. Num 17:17 , etc.; — mostly in Israel: 1. בְּעַמְּךָ ׳ נ of any chief man, Exod 22:27 ( E ; human ruler, over against אֱלֹהִים ). 2. of Solomon 1Kgs 11:34 . Elsewhere only Ezekiel, P , Chronicles: — 3. of Abraham Gen 23:6 , and heads of Ishmaelite tribes Gen 17:20 ; Gen 25:16 . 4. rulers of the congregation, נְשִׂיאֵי הָעֵדָה Exod 16:22 ; Josh 9:15 ; Josh 9:18 ; Josh 22:30 , בָּעֵדָה ׳ הַנּ Exod 34:31 , compare Exod 35:27 ; Lev 4:22 ; Josh 9:18 b; Josh 9:19 ; Josh 9:21 (twice in verse); Josh 17:4 ; Josh 22:14 (3 t. in verse); Josh 22:32 (all P ); especially 5. tribal chiefs and representatives, according to the religious organization of P , Num 1:16 ; Num 1:44 ; Num 2:3 + 57 t. Numbers (especially chapters 2, 7, 34; note נְשִׂיא נְשִׂיאֵי הַלֵּוִי Num 3:32 ); compare 1Chr 2:10 ; 1Chr 4:38 ; 1Chr 5:6 ; 1Chr 7:40 ; 2Chr 1:2 , also 1Kgs 8:1 (probably gloss, omitted by ᵐ5 Benz ), 2Chr 5:2 . 6. in Ezekiel: \\ \\ a. of Zedekiah (for מֶלֶךְ see Böhmer 8K 1900, 112 ff. ), Ezek 7:27 ; Ezek 12:10 ; Ezek 12:12 ; Ezek 21:30 , + Ezek 19:1 (read singular ᵐ5 Ew Hi Co Berthol Toy). \\ \\ b. chief men of Judah Ezek 21:17 ; Ezek 22:6 ; Ezek 45:8 ; Ezek 45:9 . \\ \\ c. future Davidic king Ezek 34:24 ; Ezek 37:25 , compare Ezek 44:3 (twice in verse) + 16 t. Ezek 45, 46, 48. \\ \\ d. foreign princes Ezek 26:16 ; Ezek 27:21 ; Ezek 30:13 ; Ezek 32:29 ; Ezek 38:2 ; Ezek 38:3 ; Ezek 39:1 ; Ezek 39:18 . 7. leader of exiles returning under Cyrus, according to Ezra 1:8 . 8. non-Israel chiefs in P : Gen 34:2 ; Num 25:18 ; Josh 13:21 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5388')\">BDB5388</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H5387')\">H5387</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5387')\">BDB5387</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB5389')\">BDB5389</entry></div><p> I. <bdbheb>נָשִׂיא</bdbheb><sub>128</sub> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>one lifted up</highlightword>, i.e. a chief prince; — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 22:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,27)\">Exod 22:27</ref> +; construct <bdbheb>נְשִׂיא</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 23:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,23,6)\">Gen 23:6</ref> +; plural <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 22:32\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,32)\">Josh 22:32</ref> +, <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 22:32\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(6,22,32)\">Josh 22:32</ref> +, <bdbheb>נְשִׂאִים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 34:31\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"34\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"34\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(2,34,31)\">Exod 34:31</ref> + 7 t., <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Gen 17:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,17,20)\">Gen 17:20</ref> + 3 t., <bdbheb>נְשִׂאִם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 35:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"35\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"35\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,35,27)\">Exod 35:27</ref> construct <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאֵי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,22)\">Exod 16:22</ref> +; suffix <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאַי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 45:8\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"45\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"45\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(26,45,8)\">Ezek 45:8</ref>, <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאֶיהָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 32:29\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"29\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"29\" onclick=\"bcv(26,32,29)\">Ezek 32:29</ref>, <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאֵיהֶם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 17:21\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,21)\">Num 17:21</ref>, <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאֵהֶם</bdbheb> v.<ref ref=\"Num 17:17\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(4,17,17)\">Num 17:17</ref>, etc.; — mostly in Israel: <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <bdbheb>בְּעַמְּךָ</bdbheb> <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>נ</bdbheb> of any chief man, <ref ref=\"Exod 22:27\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"22\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"22\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(2,22,27)\">Exod 22:27</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('E')\"><reflink>E</reflink></lookup>; human ruler, over against <bdbheb>אֱלֹהִים</bdbheb>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> of Solomon <ref ref=\"1Kgs 11:34\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(11,11,34)\">1Kgs 11:34</ref>. Elsewhere only Ezekiel, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>, Chronicles: — </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> of Abraham <ref ref=\"Gen 23:6\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(1,23,6)\">Gen 23:6</ref>, and heads of Ishmaelite tribes <ref ref=\"Gen 17:20\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"17\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"17\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(1,17,20)\">Gen 17:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Gen 25:16\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(1,25,16)\">Gen 25:16</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> rulers of the congregation, <bdbheb>נְשִׂיאֵי הָעֵדָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:22\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,22)\">Exod 16:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 9:15\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,15)\">Josh 9:15</ref>; <ref ref=\"Josh 9:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,9,18)\">Josh 9:18</ref>;