2, 7, 34; note <bdbheb>נְשִׂיא נְשִׂיאֵי הַלֵּוִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 3:32\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"32\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"32\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,32)\">Num 3:32</ref>); compare <ref ref=\"1Chr 2:10\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(13,2,10)\">1Chr 2:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:38\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"38\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"38\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,38)\">1Chr 4:38</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 5:6\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(13,5,6)\">1Chr 5:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 7:40\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"40\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"40\" onclick=\"bcv(13,7,40)\">1Chr 7:40</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Chr 1:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,1,2)\">2Chr 1:2</ref>, also <ref ref=\"1Kgs 8:1\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"8\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"8\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(11,8,1)\">1Kgs 8:1</ref> (probably gloss, omitted by <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Benz')\">Benz</lookup>), <ref ref=\"2Chr 5:2\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(14,5,2)\">2Chr 5:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>6.</b> in Ezekiel: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> of Zedekiah (for <bdbheb>מֶלֶךְ</bdbheb> see Böhmer<sup>8K 1900, 112 ff.</sup>), <ref ref=\"Ezek 7:27\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(26,7,27)\">Ezek 7:27</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:10\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,10)\">Ezek 12:10</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 12:12\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(26,12,12)\">Ezek 12:12</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 21:30\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"30\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"30\" onclick=\"bcv(26,21,30)\">Ezek 21:30</ref>, + <ref ref=\"Ezek 19:1\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"19\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"19\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(26,19,1)\">Ezek 19:1</ref> (r